white over black:
  a=  0 ->   0 (shift-by-256 would give   0)
  a= 64 ->  64 (shift-by-256 would give  63)
  a=128 -> 128 (shift-by-256 would give 127)
  a=192 -> 192 (shift-by-256 would give 191)
  a=255 -> 255 (shift-by-256 would give 254)

red over blue  at a=64: 64 0 191
blue over red  at a=64: 191 0 64
